translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_947924fc:

    # man "Hey, don’t ignore me, I’ll pay good money for those whores!"
    man "嘿，别无视我，我会为那些婊子付大价钱的！"

# game/episode017.rpy:322
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_4ccf5ae4:

    # man "Forget it, those asses don’t look that fine up close."
    man "算了，那些屁股凑近了看也没那么翘。"

# game/episode017.rpy:325
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_e15c4689:

    # man "Hey, don’t ignore me, I’ll pay good money for that whore!"
    man "嘿，别无视我，我会为那个婊子付大价钱的！"

# game/episode017.rpy:326
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_dc957e25:

    # man "Forget it, that ass doesn’t look that fine up close."
    man "算了，那个屁股凑近了看也没那么翘。"

# game/episode017.rpy:335
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_323e5087:

    # "I nearly had to restrain Lilly, because she was about to attack the cat-calling horndog."
    "我差点要按住莉莉，因为她正准备攻击那个用下流话挑逗的色鬼。"

# game/episode017.rpy:336
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_7c826617:

    # "Eventually, his shouting was drowned out by the noises of the station, and we reached the Bastard."
    "最终，他的叫喊声被空间站的嘈杂声淹没，我们到达了\"私生子\"号。"

# game/episode017.rpy:338
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_7b604a5d:

    # "One by one, the other crew members reported in after their search on the station."
    "其他船员在空间站完成搜查后，一个接一个地汇报了情况。"

# game/episode017.rpy:340
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_a8a0807f:

    # "Most of them reported similar successes to mine, but Ziv and Jade had something more positive to share."
    "他们大多汇报了与我相似的成果，但基芙和杰德带来了更积极的消息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:342
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fc104f7b:

    # zi "We’ve been able to make contact with the Taagmar."
    zi "我们已经和塔格玛人取得了联系。"

# game/episode017.rpy:343
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_124b52c3:

    # zi "As I understand, they’re quite wary of humans at the moment, whether they hail from the Sovereignty or not."
    zi "据我所知，他们目前对人类相当警惕，无论是否来自\"至高权域\"。"

# game/episode017.rpy:345
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_6f014d95:

    # e "That explains the general evasiveness."
    e "这解释了普遍的回避态度。"

# game/episode017.rpy:347
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_a8bc780f:

    # zi "One of the Taagmar dignitaries here on the station has agreed to meet us tomorrow."
    zi "空间站上的一位塔格玛显贵已同意明天与我们见面。"

# game/episode017.rpy:348
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_7f54a1e7:

    # c "Just the two of you?"
    c "就你们两个去？"

# game/episode017.rpy:350
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_ba0ecf13:

    # j "No, we’ve made sure you were included."
    j "不，我们确保把你也算进去了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:351
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_259f92ab:

    # j "They’ve allowed us to vouch for you."
    j "他们允许我们为你担保。"

# game/episode017.rpy:352
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_2edfd7ae:

    # c "Finally, some good news."
    c "总算有些好消息了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:353
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_5fe760a4:

    # c "Good job, both."
    c "干得好，两位。"

# game/episode017.rpy:355
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_88387169:

    # "As we had some time to kill until tomorrow, we all went our separate ways."
    "在明天到来之前我们有些时间要打发，于是大家各自分散行动。"

# game/episode017.rpy:356
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_41e3c6ad:

    # "Some of the crew went for a meal on the station, while others stayed on the ship to avoid the crowd."
    "部分船员去空间站用餐，其他人则留在船上避开人群。"

# game/episode017.rpy:367
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_d91e2ab2:

    # "Ignoring my own words on not drawing attention, I lunged at the fucker."
    "我把自己说过不要引人注目的话抛在脑后，猛地扑向那个混蛋。"

# game/episode017.rpy:369
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_733ac962:

    # "I lunged at him."
    "我扑向了他。"

# game/episode017.rpy:370
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_0b2ec1e7:

    # c "You’ll take that back right now."
    c "你最好立刻收回刚才的话。"

# game/episode017.rpy:371
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_0ea33c34:

    # "My fist connected with his beaked face and the alien went down."
    "我的拳头击中了他鸟喙般的脸，那个外星人应声倒地。"

# game/episode017.rpy:374
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_fd1ee5fd:

    # c "Those are my sister and dear friend you’re talking about, you miserable piece of trash!"
    c "你谈论的是我的妹妹和挚友，你这可悲的垃圾！"

# game/episode017.rpy:376
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_eede9272:

    # c "Those are my dear friends you’re talking about, you miserable piece of trash!"
    c "你谈论的是我的挚友们，你这可悲的垃圾！"

# game/episode017.rpy:379
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_03723e40:

    # c "That is my sister you’re talking about, you miserable piece of trash!"
    c "你谈论的是我的妹妹，你这可悲的垃圾！"

# game/episode017.rpy:381
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_018c4357:

    # c "That is my friend you’re talking about, you miserable piece of trash!"
    c "你谈论的是我的朋友，你这可悲的垃圾！"

# game/episode017.rpy:382
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_66524833:

    # man "I’m sorry, I didn’t mean-"
    man "我很抱歉，我不是有意-"

# game/episode017.rpy:383
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_8ee660b3:

    # c "Didn’t mean what?"
    c "不是有意什么？"

# game/episode017.rpy:384
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_7192a721:

    # c "Your meaning was pretty clear."
    c "你的意图相当明显。"

# game/episode017.rpy:386
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_30b41eb7:

    # "I continued to rain down punches on the guys face."
    "我继续对着那家伙的脸一顿猛揍。"

# game/episode017.rpy:387
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_02c28991:

    # "Our altercation hadn’t attracted a large crowd, for which I was thankful."
    "我们的争执没有引来太多围观者，对此我心存感激。"

# game/episode017.rpy:388
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_b5304995:

    # "Station security didn’t seem too interested in what happened either."
    "空间站安保似乎对我们的事也不太感兴趣。"

# game/episode017.rpy:389
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_6e252ef7:

    # "When the alien’s cries turned into pitiful sobs, I withdrew."
    "当那个外星人的哭喊变成了可怜的啜泣时，我停手了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:392
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_0618c670:

    # "Both Lilly and Vess looked a little shocked at me, but they both took my arm when offered."
    "莉莉和薇丝看起来都对我有些震惊，但她们都接受了我的搀扶。"

# game/episode017.rpy:395
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_99ffcb72:

    # "Lilly looked a little shocked at me, but she took my arm when offered."
    "莉莉看起来对我有些震惊，但她还是接受了我的搀扶。"

# game/episode017.rpy:397
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_3efa839d:

    # "A satisfied smile tugged at the corners of my sister’s mouth as we continued towards the Bastard."
    "当我们继续走向\"私生子\"号时，我妹妹嘴角浮现出满意的微笑。"

# game/episode017.rpy:399
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_encounter_fight_b05812bb:

    # "A satisfied smile tugged at the corners of my friend’s mouth as we continued towards the Bastard."
    "我朋友嘴角扬起一抹满意的微笑，我们继续朝着\"私生子\"号走去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:404
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_c4f44779:

    # "Jade sat outside the Bastard on a container, hunched over her tablet, completely lost in thought."
    "杰德坐在\"私生子\"号外的一个集装箱上，弓着背盯着她的平板，完全沉浸在思绪中。"

# game/episode017.rpy:406
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_b57fa023:

    # "She only noticed me when I sat down next to her."
    "直到我在她身边坐下，她才注意到我。"

# game/episode017.rpy:408
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_aec4a347:

    # j "Oh hey, [p_name]."
    j "哦嘿，[p_name]。"

# game/episode017.rpy:409
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_bc0be212:

    # c "Hey, not the most quiet spot to do some reading."
    c "嘿，这里可不是最安静的阅读场所。"

# game/episode017.rpy:410
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_b4f1880a:

    # j "I like the hubbub, all the noise somehow keeps me focused."
    j "我喜欢这种喧闹，所有的噪音反而能让我集中注意力。"

# game/episode017.rpy:411
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_6ba22d62:

    # c "What were you reading?"
    c "你在读什么？"

# game/episode017.rpy:413
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_8d57a18b:

    # j "Just some stuff about the Twi'll."
    j "只是一些关于特维尔人的资料。"

# game/episode017.rpy:414
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_f52b66d7:

    # c "A history book?"
    c "历史书吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:415
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_131c2ccf:

    # j "Something like that."
    j "类似的东西。"

# game/episode017.rpy:417
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_f8fa634b:

    # j "Running into that Twi'll on Douvis and the destruction of the Taagmar home world triggered something."
    j "在道维斯星遇到那个特维尔人以及塔格玛母星的毁灭触动了我。"

# game/episode017.rpy:418
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_7f875d40:

    # j "The way the Sovereignty is behaving there is awfully similar to what they did on our home world."
    j "至高权域在那里的所作所为与他们当年在我们母星上的行径惊人地相似。"

# game/episode017.rpy:419
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_c4e342ec:

    # j "I've been reading up on Paclerara and then I went down the rabbit hole."
    j "我一直在查阅帕克莱拉拉的相关资料，然后就一发不可收拾地深陷其中了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:420
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_8859eb01:

    # j "I'd just arrived at the history of tea ceremonies that were in fashion on Luclite four hundred years ago, when you interrupted."
    j "我刚读到四百年前卢克莱特星上流行的茶道历史，你就来打扰了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:421
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_a02ccb16:

    # c "Oh, tea sounds important."
    c "哦，茶听起来很重要。"

# game/episode017.rpy:422
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_29290089:

    # c "I won't keep you any longer in that case."
    c "那样的话我就不多打扰你了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:424
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_b92225e4:

    # j "Haha, no, stay."
    j "哈哈，不，留下来吧。"

# game/episode017.rpy:425
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_7f72f7af:

    # j "I already know more about tea than I should."
    j "我对茶的了解已经够多了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:427
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_82ffc501:

    # j "I do wish we could visit Paclerara at some point, visit my mother's grave."
    j "我真希望有天能去帕克莱拉拉看看，祭拜我母亲的坟墓。"

# game/episode017.rpy:428
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_e43a8bd4:

    # c "We'll try as soon as we're able."
    c "等我们一有能力就会想办法去的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:430
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_01fd7748:

    # j "I'd appreciate that."
    j "我会很感激的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:432
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_d806ba03:

    # "Jade and I stared into the distance, ignoring the many passers-by."
    "我和杰德凝视着远方，无视众多路人。"

# game/episode017.rpy:433
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_8f1914f4:

    # "She was the first to break the silence."
    "她率先打破了沉默。"

# game/episode017.rpy:435
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_53e1450d:

    # j "I sometimes think it's crazy how far we've managed to come."
    j "我有时觉得我们能走到这一步简直疯狂。"

# game/episode017.rpy:436
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_bf4bc3c6:

    # c "I guess you don't mean the distance we've traveled?"
    c "我猜你不是指我们旅行的距离？"

# game/episode017.rpy:438
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_cb5244dd:

    # j "No, I mean, we've started out with a stolen ship, escaped the Sovereignty, visited a great many planets and got out of many hairy situations."
    j "不，我的意思是，我们从偷来的飞船起步，逃离了\"至高权域\"，访问了众多星球，还从许多险境中脱身。"

# game/episode017.rpy:439
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_4acaaeca:

    # c "Well, if you put it that way."
    c "好吧，如果你这么说的话。"

# game/episode017.rpy:440
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_d125a393:

    # c "Though I mostly want a quiet drink in a quiet place, and someone else saving the galaxy or whatever the hell we're doing."
    c "虽然我主要只想要在安静的地方喝杯小酒，让别人去拯救银河系或我们正在做的这些破事。"

# game/episode017.rpy:442
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_a2aec314:

    # j "Still, we've had quite the adventure so far."
    j "尽管如此，我们至今的冒险经历确实相当精彩。"

# game/episode017.rpy:443
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_f4e24f94:

    # j "And I think I'm better off now."
    j "而且我觉得我现在过得更好。"

# game/episode017.rpy:444
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_2374e24d:

    # j "Being an attendant was all I ever knew and I didn't really realize the wrongness of it all."
    j "做一名侍从是我唯一知晓的身份，我从未真正意识到这一切有何不妥。"

# game/episode017.rpy:446
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_2269aaea:

    # j "I just couldn't imagine being anything else, if you know what I mean."
    j "我根本无法想象自己还能成为别的什么，如果你明白我的意思。"

# game/episode017.rpy:447
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_3275e9ef:

    # c "I think so."
    c "我想我明白。"

# game/episode017.rpy:448
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_12f129bb:

    # c "It's a rotten thing the Sovereignty did to you."
    c "\"至高权域\"对你做的这些事真是龌龊。"

# game/episode017.rpy:449
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_3356e9cd:

    # c "No, what I did to you."
    c "不，是我对你做的那些事。"

# game/episode017.rpy:450
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_3ee040d7:

    # c "I mean, you were a birthday gift..."
    c "我是说，你当初是作为生日礼物被送来的…"

# game/episode017.rpy:452
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_69dbd27e:

    # j "Yes, I remember being terrified when I was to meet you for the first time."
    j "是的，我还记得第一次去见你时有多害怕。"

# game/episode017.rpy:453
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_6752e3a3:

    # j "I was relieved you were such a nice guy, because I've heard some horror stories over the years."
    j "发现你是个这么好的人，我才松了口气，这些年来我听过太多可怕的故事了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:455
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_d5c4100d:

    # j "Girls getting beat up, used by the entire family for their pleasure, or made to suffer in some sex dungeon."
    j "有些女孩被殴打，被全家人当作玩物取乐，或者被困在性爱地牢里受苦。"

# game/episode017.rpy:456
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_44985f6b:

    # j "All things considered, I didn't have it so bad."
    j "总的来说，我的遭遇还不算太糟。"

# game/episode017.rpy:457
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_79c770a2:

    # c "Still, you were supposed to be my property."
    c "尽管如此，你本该是我的财产。"

# game/episode017.rpy:459
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_f467471f:

    # c "I could have refused, like Thim did."
    c "我本可以拒绝，就像蒂姆那样。"

# game/episode017.rpy:461
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_c19c5a5d:

    # c "I could have refused."
    c "我本可以拒绝的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:463
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_22e29c09:

    # j "That would have been noble and I might have ended up with a creepy old man, chained to a post."
    j "那样做或许很高尚，但我也可能最终落到一个变态老头手里，被锁在柱子上。"

# game/episode017.rpy:464
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_3e05188b:

    # j "I'm not saying you shouldn't feel bad about the treatment of Twi'll, or me personally, but for me everything worked out in the end."
    j "我不是说你不该为特维尔人的遭遇感到愧疚，或者为我个人感到愧疚，但对我来说，最终一切都解决了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:466
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_239ea88f:

    # j "I got my freedom and got to stay with the man I came to love."
    j "我获得了自由，还能留在我逐渐爱上的人身边。"

# game/episode017.rpy:467
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_2f250e97:

    # j "So, all in all, I had a better deal."
    j "所以总的来说，我的处境还算不错。"

# game/episode017.rpy:468
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_8c1853f3:

    # c "I can't really imagine what you've been through."
    c "我真的无法想象你经历了什么。"

# game/episode017.rpy:469
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_fa562646:

    # c "I'm sorry I never thought to ask, but were you just dumped into my lap?"
    c "很抱歉我从未想过要问，你是直接被丢到我手里的吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:471
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_39ea0227:

    # j "No, not at all."
    j "不，完全不是这样。"

# game/episode017.rpy:473
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_d69cf7f9:

    # j "The Sovereignty makes sure the attendants get all the training they need."
    j "\"至高权域\"确保随从们获得所有必要的训练。"

# game/episode017.rpy:474
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_9be70cbf:

    # j "In contrast to the dire treatment most Twi'll receive after becoming an attendant, the Sovereignty makes very sure their valuable assets are protected."
    j "与大多数特维尔人成为随从后遭受的可怕待遇形成鲜明对比的是，\"至高权域\"非常确保他们这些宝贵资产受到保护。"

# game/episode017.rpy:475
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_bc6756f0:

    # j "So genders aren't allowed to mingle and any physical contact is forbidden, even between members of the same sex."
    j "所以不允许不同性别接触，任何身体接触都被禁止，即使是同性之间也不例外。"

# game/episode017.rpy:476
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_bbdad92c:

    # j "Which was a challenge, considering the amount of detailed audiovisual instruction we received."
    j "考虑到我们接收到的详细视听指导数量，这确实是个挑战。"

# game/episode017.rpy:478
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_4e161613:

    # j "I don't have to tell you the effect of too much stimulating imagery on the minds of youngsters just finding out the things down below is for something more than peeing..."
    j "我不必告诉你过多刺激性影像对刚发现下面那玩意儿除了小便还有别的用处的年轻人会产生什么影响…"

# game/episode017.rpy:479
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_9a60c2bb:

    # c "Nope."
    c "不。"

# game/episode017.rpy:481
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_613e0719:

    # j "Then training was over and we were sent out."
    j "然后训练结束了，我们被派了出去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:483
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_a341cc0b:

    # j "And I found myself naked on a couch in a mansion, head full of knowledge to please a human and absolutely no clue what to do at all."
    j "我发现自己赤身裸体地躺在豪宅的沙发上，脑子里装满了取悦人类的知识，却完全不知道该做什么。"

# game/episode017.rpy:484
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_47a65c08:

    # c "I remember that moment."
    c "我记得那一刻。"

# game/episode017.rpy:485
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_15af1c9b:

    # c "Everybody clapping as I walked into the room."
    c "当我走进房间时，所有人都在鼓掌。"

# game/episode017.rpy:486
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_2006f9fd:

    # c "My father standing proudly in the center, slapping me on the shoulder."
    c "我父亲自豪地站在中央，拍着我的肩膀。"

# game/episode017.rpy:487
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_35ccee82:

    # c "Him telling me I'd finally become a man, or some inane bullshit with a similar meaning."
    c "他对我说我终于长大成人了，或者类似的屁话。"

# game/episode017.rpy:488
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_751c0cab:

    # c "I'm so glad we left that all behind."
    c "真高兴我们把这些都抛在脑后了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:490
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_cc5e28a7:

    # j "As am I."
    j "我也是。"

# game/episode017.rpy:491
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_a2fbbdac:

    # c "You've got to wonder though, why nobody has ever thought to burn the whole Sovereignty to the ground."
    c "不过你肯定会想，为什么从来没人想过要把整个\"至高权域\"烧成灰烬。"

# game/episode017.rpy:493
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_9a1cd484:

    # j "I'm sure it's been tried."
    j "我相信肯定有人试过。"

# game/episode017.rpy:495
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_516e4a65:

    # j "And I know that there have been attempts by the Twi'll, especially in the early days after we were conquered."
    j "而且我知道特维尔人尝试过，尤其是在我们被征服后的早期。"

# game/episode017.rpy:496
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_ab45f477:

    # j "The Sovereignty is quick to stamp those fires out..."
    j "\"至高权域\"会迅速扑灭这些火种…"

# game/episode017.rpy:498
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_b9f96482:

    # j "So it's rather hard to topple an empire like the Sovereignty with a few scattered rebels."
    j "所以想要用一群散兵游勇推翻像\"至高权域\"这样的帝国相当困难。"

# game/episode017.rpy:499
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_70207868:

    # c "Yes, I’m sure it’s a challenge, but one can hope."
    c "是的，我知道这是个挑战，但人总可以抱有希望。"

# game/episode017.rpy:501
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_a7627367:

    # j "True, true."
    j "确实，确实如此。"

# game/episode017.rpy:503
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_c8f96d6c:

    # "We continued watching the crowd flow among us in silence for a while."
    "我们又默默注视了一会儿人群中人来人往。"

# game/episode017.rpy:504
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_92bce088:

    # c "Well, I’ll leave you to learn everything there is to know about tea."
    c "好吧，我就不打扰你学习所有关于茶的知识了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:506
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_0c7bf418:

    # j "I’ll tell you all about someone called Earl Grey, once I’m done."
    j "等我弄明白后，会跟你讲讲一个叫格雷伯爵的人。"

# game/episode017.rpy:508
translate simplified_chinese ep017_jade_c0e00c6b:

    # c "Can’t wait!"
    c "等不及了！"

# game/episode017.rpy:520
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_1cd05b35:

    # woman "Come to us, [p_name]."
    woman "到我们这儿来，[p_name]。"

# game/episode017.rpy:527
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_37bf75b5:

    # woman "We require a Tasting!"
    woman "我们需要一次品鉴！"

# game/episode017.rpy:528
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_97cd46cb:

    # woman "You’re ours now!"
    woman "你现在属于我们了！"

# game/episode017.rpy:529
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_eae746a4:

    # woman "Don’t resist."
    woman "不要反抗。"

# game/episode017.rpy:536
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_f7468510:

    # woman "We long to Taste the fornication."
    woman "我们渴望品尝交合的滋味。"

# game/episode017.rpy:537
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_073ddb03:

    # woman "The debauchery, so sweet on our tongue."
    woman "那放荡的滋味，在我们舌尖如此甘甜。"

# game/episode017.rpy:538
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_bdfc864f:

    # woman "The forbidden love consummated with abandon."
    woman "那恣意放纵的禁忌之爱。"

# game/episode017.rpy:539
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_34179e45:

    # woman "Come to us, [p_name]!"
    woman "到我们这儿来，[p_name]！"

# game/episode017.rpy:540
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_8de530d8:

    # woman "Come!"
    woman "来吧！"

# game/episode017.rpy:547
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_1c177270:

    # "So, that’s when the dreams began."
    "就这样，那些梦境开始了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:548
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_bbb0b958:

    # "I jolted awake with a scream, breathing heavily."
    "我尖叫着惊醒，大口喘着粗气。"

# game/episode017.rpy:553
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_4c2c3245:

    # "The comforting presence of Vess next to me didn’t diminish the fear that clawed its way through my chest."
    "身旁薇丝令人安心的存在，并未减轻撕扯着我胸膛的恐惧。"

# game/episode017.rpy:555
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_03a7ba81:

    # ve "[p_name_short], are you alright?"
    ve "[p_name_short]，你还好吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:556
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_98dc40a8:

    # c "I just had the worst nightmare."
    c "我刚才做了最可怕的噩梦。"

# game/episode017.rpy:558
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_4feb16cf:

    # ve "You were screaming."
    ve "你刚才在尖叫。"

# game/episode017.rpy:559
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_be745336:

    # c "I thought one of the Scolguin was in the room."
    c "我以为房间里有个斯科尔金人。"

# game/episode017.rpy:561
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_487754d3:

    # ve "In the room, with us?"
    ve "在房间里，和我们一起？"

# game/episode017.rpy:562
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_52333ea5:

    # c "Exactly, it felt all too real."
    c "没错，感觉太真实了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:563
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_6dd0bd37:

    # ve "Maybe your brain is trying to work through everything that happened?"
    ve "也许你的大脑正在试图消化发生的一切？"

# game/episode017.rpy:564
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_50a2e315:

    # c "Could be, but I didn’t have any dreams after my dad threw me out of an airlock."
    c "有可能，但我爸把我扔出气闸后并没有做任何噩梦。"

# game/episode017.rpy:566
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_f24aafdd:

    # ve "You’re here with me now, nothing can happen to us."
    ve "你现在和我在一起，我们不会出什么事的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:567
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_9b3a1aef:

    # "I could think of several bad things that could happen to us, but I appreciated Vess’ compassionate sentiment."
    "我能想到好几件可能发生的坏事，但我感激薇丝这番体贴的心意。"

# game/episode017.rpy:569
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_c5dbb21d:

    # "Vess kissed me, and together we fell asleep after a while."
    "薇丝亲吻了我，过了一会儿我们一起睡着了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:574
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_e2e3eed9:

    # "The comforting presence of Raene next to me didn’t diminish the fear that clawed its way through my chest."
    "蕾妮在我身边的慰藉并未减轻那撕扯我胸膛的恐惧。"

# game/episode017.rpy:576
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_50bd9c3f:

    # ra "What’s the matter, [p_name_short]?"
    ra "怎么了，[p_name_short]？"

# game/episode017.rpy:577
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_e3d4fa3d:

    # ra "Are you alright?"
    ra "你还好吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:578
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_cbd07190:

    # c "I had a bad dream."
    c "我做了个噩梦。"

# game/episode017.rpy:580
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_c70f8a80:

    # ra "It must have been very bad, you were screaming just now."
    ra "那一定非常糟糕，你刚才一直在尖叫。"

# game/episode017.rpy:581
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_f40b76e7:

    # c "The Scolguin decided to come and visit."
    c "斯科尔金决定来拜访了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:583
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_a05c6a2c:

    # ra "You dreamt you were back there again?"
    ra "你梦见自己又回到了那里？"

# game/episode017.rpy:584
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_9840d7a6:

    # c "No, one of them was actually here in the room."
    c "不，他们中有一个真的在房间里。"

# game/episode017.rpy:585
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_1549eb89:

    # c "It felt all too real."
    c "感觉太真实了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:586
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_15aa9be1:

    # ra "Maybe your mind is trying to make sense of what happened to you?"
    ra "也许你的大脑在试图理解发生在你身上的事？"

# game/episode017.rpy:587
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_13251290:

    # c "Maybe."
    c "也许吧。"

# game/episode017.rpy:588
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_53b9973e:

    # c "I didn’t have those dreams right after I was dumped as a sacrifice for them."
    c "在我被当成祭品扔给他们之后，并没有马上做这些梦。"

# game/episode017.rpy:589
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_111ff40a:

    # ra "Lots happened afterwards, maybe your subconscious has gotten some time to settle?"
    ra "后来发生了很多事，或许你的潜意识需要时间消化？"

# game/episode017.rpy:590
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_299d153d:

    # c "I don’t know."
    c "我不知道。"

# game/episode017.rpy:591
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_f7f774bf:

    # c "I sure hope my subconscious is done processing everything, that Scolguin looked all too real."
    c "我当然希望我的潜意识已经处理完所有事情，那个斯科尔金看起来太真实了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:593
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_5646968f:

    # ra "You’re safe here, with me."
    ra "你在这里很安全，和我在一起。"

# game/episode017.rpy:594
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_1756ac63:

    # "Though I doubted Raene’s, or actually anyone’s, ability to shield me from the Scolguin, I appreciated the sentiment wholeheartedly."
    "虽然我怀疑蕾妮—或者说任何人—是否有能力保护我免受斯科尔金伤害，但我真心感激这份心意。"

# game/episode017.rpy:596
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_ad3d8d06:

    # "Raene kissed me, and together we fell asleep after a while."
    "蕾妮亲吻了我，过了一会儿我们一起睡着了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:598
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_6ec4b75b:

    # "It took several minutes for me to compose myself."
    "我花了几分钟才让自己镇定下来。"

# game/episode017.rpy:599
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_66598c05:

    # "My bedroom suddenly didn’t feel all that safe anymore."
    "我的卧室突然感觉不再那么安全了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:600
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_b01f5571:

    # "I hesitated to go out and wander the ship for a while, but decided against it eventually."
    "我犹豫着要不要出去在飞船里转一会儿，但最终还是放弃了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:602
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_3880ae4e:

    # "When I’d calmed down somewhat, I tried to sleep again."
    "当我稍微平静下来后，我又试着入睡。"

# game/episode017.rpy:603
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_e6fd5088:

    # "It took a very long time until I sank back into a very light sleep."
    "过了很久，我才重新陷入浅眠。"

# game/episode017.rpy:605
translate simplified_chinese ep017_first_dream_1f48d60f:

    # "The Scolguin didn’t return."
    "斯科尔金人没有再次出现。"

# game/episode017.rpy:617
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_f2249756:

    # woman2 "Bow before your Queen."
    woman2 "向你的女王鞠躬。"

# game/episode017.rpy:622
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_e69e42b8:

    # c "No."
    c "不。"

# game/episode017.rpy:623
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_c233aa7e:

    # woman2 "We have an agreement."
    woman2 "我们有过约定。"

# game/episode017.rpy:626
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_68bd0ed9:

    # c "You have an agreement with my mother."
    c "你和我母亲有约定。"

# game/episode017.rpy:628
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_a2346b1c:

    # c "You have an agreement with Nadya."
    c "你和娜迪亚有约定。"

# game/episode017.rpy:630
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_55732973:

    # c "We do."
    c "确实如此。"

# game/episode017.rpy:631
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_00b89926:

    # c "That agreement isn’t due for another ten fucking years."
    c "那个该死的约定还有整整十年才到期。"

# game/episode017.rpy:633
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_8bc91a78:

    # woman2 "We crave the Taste!"
    woman2 "我们渴望那滋味！"

# game/episode017.rpy:634
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_08ab882b:

    # woman2 "Allow us in!"
    woman2 "让我们进来！"

# game/episode017.rpy:635
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_b24eec5e:

    # woman2 "We want you, we need you!"
    woman2 "我们想要你，我们需要你！"

# game/episode017.rpy:636
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_d7343f2d:

    # c "No, and get the fuck out of my head!"
    c "不，快他妈滚出我的脑袋！"

# game/episode017.rpy:638
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_cc9f8f08:

    # woman "We crave you, we need you!"
    woman "我们渴望你，我们需要你！"

# game/episode017.rpy:640
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_cbc11291:

    # woman2 "Allow us in, and you won’t regret it."
    woman2 "让我们进来，你不会后悔的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:641
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_368ea721:

    # woman2 "Boundless pleasure awaits..."
    woman2 "无尽的欢愉在等待…"

# game/episode017.rpy:642
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_ba9657e1:

    # woman2 "Give in, [p_name]!"
    woman2 "屈服吧，[p_name]！"

# game/episode017.rpy:644
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_45f04cf1:

    # woman "Give in!{w} Give in!{w} Give in!"
    woman "屈服吧！{w} 屈服吧！{w} 屈服吧！"

# game/episode017.rpy:645
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_eb46fe9f:

    # c "No!"
    c "不！"

# game/episode017.rpy:647
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_b404f39f:

    # woman2 "[p_name]!"
    woman2 "[p_name]!"

# game/episode017.rpy:649
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_94a9db8c:

    # woman2 "[p_name_short]!"
    woman2 "[p_name_short]!"

# game/episode017.rpy:650
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_4a1a4c0c:

    # "I awoke shouting at the cold night sky, Eva tugging at my arm and speaking my name."
    "我对着寒冷的夜空大喊着醒来，伊娃拽着我的手臂呼唤着我的名字。"

# game/episode017.rpy:658
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_371821c2:

    # e "[p_name_short]!"
    e "[p_name_short]!"

# game/episode017.rpy:659
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_1a4f5d59:

    # e "It was just a dream."
    e "那只是个梦。"

# game/episode017.rpy:660
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_3f702b41:

    # e "You’re here now, with me."
    e "你现在和我在一起。"

# game/episode017.rpy:661
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_b3e5f9d5:

    # c "Eva?"
    c "伊娃？"

# game/episode017.rpy:667
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_ef938a46:

    # "I came to my senses and pulled Eva close, kissing her just to make sure she was real."
    "我回过神来，将伊娃拉近，亲吻她以确认她是真实的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:669
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_81859680:

    # "When I noticed Eva's teeth were clattering, I eased her back into the sleeping bag and pulled the covers up."
    "当我注意到伊娃的牙齿在打颤时，我把她轻轻放回睡袋，拉上了被褥。"

# game/episode017.rpy:671
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_d80b4a3b:

    # "I came to my senses and pulled the sleeping bag up to stave away the cold."
    "我回过神来，拉上睡袋抵御寒冷。"

# game/episode017.rpy:672
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_f59db4dc:

    # c "I thought we were surrounded by Scolguin."
    c "我以为我们被斯科尔金人包围了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:673
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_923b4dbc:

    # c "They wanted to remind me of our deal with them."
    c "他们想提醒我与他们达成的协议。"

# game/episode017.rpy:674
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_9d3283cf:

    # e "Did it seem so real?"
    e "感觉那么真实吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:675
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_05913c53:

    # c "It did, though it couldn’t be, they’re light-years away."
    c "确实很真实，虽然不可能，他们在数光年之外。"

# game/episode017.rpy:680
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_1d60fe24:

    # e "Maybe you’re just working through all the events of the recent past?"
    e "也许你只是在消化最近发生的所有事情？"

# game/episode017.rpy:682
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_ad330eb1:

    # c "Maybe, but it’s a rather persistent dream..."
    c "也许吧，但这梦境相当顽固…"

# game/episode017.rpy:684
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_23577c28:

    # c "You’re not the first to say that."
    c "你不是第一个这么说的人。"

# game/episode017.rpy:685
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_66e25bda:

    # e "This isn’t the first time it happened?"
    e "这不是第一次发生吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:686
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_92d78f2c:

    # c "No, it happened back on Altum Station as well."
    c "不，之前在阿尔图姆站也发生过。"

# game/episode017.rpy:687
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_ae2aa998:

    # c "I brushed it off back then, but now I’m not so sure."
    c "那时我没当回事，但现在我不那么确定了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:692
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_d01f7e59:

    # e "Seems too much of a coincidence."
    e "看起来太巧合了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:693
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_b3ba43d5:

    # e "Do you think the Scolguin did something to you?"
    e "你觉得斯科尔金人对你做了什么吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:694
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_a3c3f462:

    # c "Maybe, could be that scan they did."
    c "有可能，可能是他们做的那个扫描。"

# game/episode017.rpy:699
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_e6193df8:

    # e "So now they can reach you in your dreams?"
    e "所以现在他们能在你的梦里找到你？"

# game/episode017.rpy:700
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_adf80b90:

    # c "I’m not sure if they’re doing it on purpose, or if it’s some sort of far-reaching desire they’re somehow projecting."
    c "我不确定他们是不是故意的，还是他们在以某种方式投射某种深远的欲望。"

# game/episode017.rpy:701
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_2ff4ac38:

    # e "That’s some very strong desire, if it’s the latter."
    e "如果是后者的话，那这欲望可真是强烈。"

# game/episode017.rpy:702
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_a29d5fec:

    # c "Yeah, just my luck."
    c "是啊，我就是这么走运。"

# game/episode017.rpy:703
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_60e8266f:

    # c "I thought we were rid of them for ten years."
    c "我还以为我们已经摆脱他们十年了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:704
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_810b95b8:

    # c "Either way, I’m going to have to do something about it, if we ever get out of this sandpit."
    c "不管怎样，如果我们能离开这个沙坑，我得对此采取些行动。"

# game/episode017.rpy:706
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_c993be95:

    # e "Maybe Thim can run some neural scans."
    e "也许蒂姆能做些神经扫描。"

# game/episode017.rpy:708
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_988230cd:

    # e "Maybe the ship can run some neural scans."
    e "也许飞船能做些神经扫描。"

# game/episode017.rpy:709
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_fabe4767:

    # c "Maybe..."
    c "也许…"

# game/episode017.rpy:710
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_60a3d645:

    # c "Let’s go back to sleep."
    c "我们继续睡吧。"

# game/episode017.rpy:711
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_5bd716ff:

    # e "Good idea."
    e "好主意。"

# game/episode017.rpy:716
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_afa1cc95:

    # e "And [p_name_short], just so you know, I’m right beside you."
    e "还有[p_name_short]，你要知道，我就在你身边。"

# game/episode017.rpy:720
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_d8fae1bd:

    # "I pulled my sister closer and kissed her in response."
    "我把妹妹拉得更近，吻了她作为回应。"

# game/episode017.rpy:722
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_39ced40e:

    # "I pulled my girlfriend closer and kissed her in response."
    "我把女友拉得更近，吻了她作为回应。"

# game/episode017.rpy:724
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_179410c1:

    # "When we came away breathless, I could only manage to whisper my thanks for her support, before we both fell into a deep sleep."
    "当我们气喘吁吁地分开时，我只能轻声感谢她的支持，随后我们都陷入了沉睡。"

# game/episode017.rpy:727
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_b85baafc:

    # c "Thank you, Eva, that means a lot."
    c "谢谢你，伊娃，这对我很重要。"

# game/episode017.rpy:729
translate simplified_chinese ep017_second_dream_125f522e:

    # "We fell asleep soon afterwards."
    "我们很快就睡着了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:735
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_c093a382:

    # "In the morning, Ziv, Jade and I headed out to the area where the Taagmar dignitary was supposed to be."
    "早上，基芙、杰德和我前往塔格玛要员应该在的区域。"

# game/episode017.rpy:737
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_9487acdf:

    # "Station officials had assigned part of the residential area for Taagmar refugees."
    "空间站官员已将部分住宅区分配给塔格玛难民。"

# game/episode017.rpy:739
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_f1500ee1:

    # "Most of the refugees kept out of our way, but I wondered just how much the presence of Ziv and Jade ensured I wasn’t assaulted by an angry mob of Taagmar."
    "大多数难民都避开了我们，但我想知道基芙和杰德的存在在多大程度上确保了我不会被愤怒的塔格玛暴民袭击。"

# game/episode017.rpy:740
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_c9ee18b7:

    # c "The Taagmar don’t seem too happy about our visit."
    c "塔格玛人对我们的到访似乎不太高兴。"

# game/episode017.rpy:742
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_0450234c:

    # zi "I wouldn’t blame them, considering the invasion of their home planet."
    zi "考虑到他们的母星遭到入侵，我不会责怪他们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:744
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_4668942a:

    # j "I hope the Taagmar official is willing to provide us with some information."
    j "希望塔格玛官员愿意向我们提供些信息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:745
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_d01a26d1:

    # c "The fact that they want to deal with us in the first place seems hopeful."
    c "他们愿意首先与我们接触这个事实本身就令人充满希望。"

# game/episode017.rpy:746
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_96e5df12:

    # c "Are we dealing with a politician or an ambassador?"
    c "我们要打交道的是政客还是大使？"

# game/episode017.rpy:748
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_bc27ddcd:

    # zi "No, I think she’s a low-level member of the Taagmar priesthood."
    zi "不，我认为她是塔格玛祭司团里的低级成员。"

# game/episode017.rpy:749
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_0ea4af1a:

    # c "That might simplify our conversation."
    c "这或许能让我们的对话更简单些。"

# game/episode017.rpy:750
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_ac3379bc:

    # c "Any politician would probably try to stonewall us."
    c "任何政客都可能试图搪塞我们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:752
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_bc6cfcfe:

    # "One of the corridors was heavily guarded, but we were waved through."
    "其中一条走廊戒备森严，但我们被挥手放行了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:754
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_dd48ecb2:

    # "The Taagmar official was sitting on the floor and appeared to be meditating."
    "塔格玛官员正席地而坐，似乎在冥想。"

# game/episode017.rpy:756
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_39440259:

    # zi "We have business with your superior and have arranged a meeting yesterday."
    zi "我们有要事与你的上级商谈，昨天已安排了会面。"

# game/episode017.rpy:759
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_8060e2f8:

    # woman "Yes, you may continue."
    woman "是的，你可以继续。"

# game/episode017.rpy:760
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_e4affeb8:

    # zi "Good day, your holiness, we’ve come to petition the Taagmar for information."
    zi "日安，圣座，我们前来请求塔格玛人提供信息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:764
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_19ebb80d:

    # woman "I’m hardly a representative of the Taagmar government."
    woman "我几乎算不上塔格玛政府的代表。"

# game/episode017.rpy:765
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_60290687:

    # woman "To what subject does your request pertain?"
    woman "你们的请求涉及什么主题？"

# game/episode017.rpy:767
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_3b05d744:

    # zi "I understand we have come at a difficult time, but we would like to learn more about the invasion of your world."
    zi "我理解我们来得不是时候，但我们想了解更多关于你们世界被入侵的情况。"

# game/episode017.rpy:769
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_b030a65c:

    # woman "Our planet is turned into a wasteland, what more do you need to know?"
    woman "我们的星球已变成荒地，你们还想知道什么？"

# game/episode017.rpy:772
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_8167ce57:

    # c "We know the Sovereignty is looking for something on your planet, possibly near the capital."
    c "我们知道\"至高权域\"在你们星球上寻找某物，可能就在首都附近。"

# game/episode017.rpy:774
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_c8686e0f:

    # woman "And you want to do what, stop them?"
    woman "那你们想做什么，阻止他们？"

# game/episode017.rpy:775
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_251ad502:

    # c "We’d like to investigate the situation and possibly stop them."
    c "我们想调查情况并可能阻止他们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:776
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_9a22cb66:

    # woman "You’re either delusional or grave robbers."
    woman "你们要么是妄想症患者，要么是盗墓贼。"

# game/episode017.rpy:777
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_d92ce6b7:

    # woman "I have no interest in dealing with either."
    woman "我对跟任何一种人打交道都没兴趣。"

# game/episode017.rpy:779
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_0d556dac:

    # woman "You’re dismissed."
    woman "你们可以退下了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:781
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_491e000a:

    # "Protesting seemed fruitless, so we turned around and left."
    "抗议似乎毫无意义，于是我们转身离开。"

# game/episode017.rpy:783
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_ef68b707:

    # "When we had crossed the residential area, one of the guards hurried towards us."
    "当我们穿过住宅区时，一名守卫匆忙向我们走来。"

# game/episode017.rpy:787
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_a9dc289c:

    # woman "I overheard you talking about wanting to get inside the capital."
    woman "我听到你们说想进入首都。"

# game/episode017.rpy:788
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_bfc9bb53:

    # woman "I think I can be of assistance."
    woman "我想我能帮上忙。"

# game/episode017.rpy:789
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_dd1c5d94:

    # c "Do you have any information?"
    c "你有什么情报吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:791
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_d1683bbc:

    # woman "I do...{w} For the right price..."
    woman "我有…{w}只要价钱合适…"

# game/episode017.rpy:792
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_fb00336c:

    # c "How much?"
    c "要多少？"

# game/episode017.rpy:794
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_003e1263:

    # woman "A thousand credits should do the trick."
    woman "一千信用点应该就够了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:795
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_d07ad229:

    # c "Seven hundred."
    c "七百。"

# game/episode017.rpy:796
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_115d305c:

    # woman "Nine."
    woman "九百。"

# game/episode017.rpy:797
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_d4e17d30:

    # c "Eight."
    c "八百。"

# game/episode017.rpy:798
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_02871268:

    # woman "Eight fifty, or you can try your luck with the priestess again."
    woman "八百五十，或者你可以再去找女祭司碰碰运气。"

# game/episode017.rpy:799
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_8404ab5e:

    # c "Fine."
    c "好的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:801
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_9099e0ac:

    # woman "I want the money upfront."
    woman "我要先拿到钱。"

# game/episode017.rpy:802
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_8f240135:

    # c "Not going to happen."
    c "这不可能。"

# game/episode017.rpy:803
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_9a00ed72:

    # c "I can give you a hundred up front."
    c "我可以先给你一百。"

# game/episode017.rpy:805
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_600d1e78:

    # woman "Half, or no deal."
    woman "一半，否则免谈。"

# game/episode017.rpy:806
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_0eeb6918:

    # c "Three hundred and the rest after we receive the info."
    c "三百，剩下的等我们收到信息后付清。"

# game/episode017.rpy:807
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_fa45ed42:

    # woman "Agreed."
    woman "同意。"

# game/episode017.rpy:808
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_65cf6421:

    # "I got out my tablet and wired the amount to the guard."
    "我拿出平板电脑，将金额转账给了守卫。"

# game/episode017.rpy:809
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_5c44ef4c:

    # c "Your turn."
    c "轮到你了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:811
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_b30617c1:

    # woman "Right."
    woman "好的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:812
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_f5e99176:

    # woman "The invading forces are indeed concentrating on the capital."
    woman "入侵部队确实正在首都集结。"

# game/episode017.rpy:813
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_5b4e37fe:

    # woman "The Grand Arch of Taag is right in the middle of the city and they’re probably trying to reach it."
    woman "塔格大拱门就位于城市正中央，他们很可能想攻占那里。"

# game/episode017.rpy:814
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_bc50da23:

    # c "What’s so special about that arch?"
    c "那座拱门有什么特别的？"

# game/episode017.rpy:816
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_da158bb6:

    # woman "It’s one of the major religious buildings on our home world."
    woman "那是我们母星上重要的宗教建筑之一。"

# game/episode017.rpy:817
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_d131fc9a:

    # woman "Why the Sovereignty has such an interest in the arch, I don’t know."
    woman "我不明白为何\"至高权域\"会对那座拱门如此感兴趣。"

# game/episode017.rpy:818
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_5d87092f:

    # woman "The arch has been there for forever, even before the Taagmar ever existed on the planet."
    woman "那座拱门已经存在了无数岁月，甚至早在塔格玛人出现在这个星球之前就存在了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:819
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_5c3058d4:

    # c "What makes you think the Sovereignty is targeting the building specifically?"
    c "是什么让你认为\"至高权域\"在专门针对那座建筑？"

# game/episode017.rpy:821
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_21fde57b:

    # woman "Multiple strike teams have been intercepted near the arch."
    woman "多支突击队在那座拱门附近被拦截了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:822
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_bfb5a777:

    # woman "Because direct strikes didn’t work out that well for them, they’re just trying to take the whole city and be done with it that way."
    woman "因为直接打击对他们来说效果不佳，他们现在只想占领整座城市，以此了结此事。"

# game/episode017.rpy:823
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_dcef3f4f:

    # c "Any other pointers you can give us?"
    c "你还能给我们什么其他线索吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:825
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_a39928f7:

    # woman "I can give you the exact location of the arch."
    woman "我可以给你拱门的确切位置。"

# game/episode017.rpy:826
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_7a22ad1e:

    # woman "As for landing near the capital, you’re on your own."
    woman "至于在首都附近降落，那就靠你们自己了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:828
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_41f41b99:

    # woman "I hope whatever you’re trying to find over there is worth it, as touching down is likely suicide, the entire planet is a warzone."
    woman "我希望你们想在那里找到的东西值得这么做，因为着陆很可能是自杀行为，整个星球都是战区。"

# game/episode017.rpy:829
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_b7f4b180:

    # c "Noted."
    c "知道了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:830
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_8da22c86:

    # woman "That’s all I know."
    woman "我知道的就这些了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:832
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_62f5cc0f:

    # "The guard held her tablet out in response, waiting for the remaining funds to be wired."
    "守卫随即拿出她的平板，等待剩余资金的转账。"

# game/episode017.rpy:833
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_2a319f5b:

    # "Begrudgingly, I complied, and then we left without any further pleasantries."
    "我勉强照做了，之后我们没再多说客套话就离开了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:836
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_af044583:

    # c "A friend of ours is still stuck on your planet and we’re looking for a way to evacuate her."
    c "我们的一个朋友还困在你们的星球上，我们正在想办法撤离她。"

# game/episode017.rpy:838
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_ba04762f:

    # woman "Your friend is fighting for the Sovereignty, killing our people?"
    woman "你的朋友在为\"至高权域\"作战，杀害我们的人民？"

# game/episode017.rpy:839
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_bf557386:

    # c "No, not at all."
    c "不，完全不是。"

# game/episode017.rpy:840
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_42c833dc:

    # c "She’s a merchant by trade and happened to be planet-side at the time of the invasion."
    c "她是个商人，入侵发生时碰巧在行星地表。"

# game/episode017.rpy:841
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_ed6cee27:

    # c "I can assure you that neither we nor she have any love for the Sovereignty."
    c "我可以向你保证，我们和她都对\"至高权域\"毫无好感。"

# game/episode017.rpy:843
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_50b2273f:

    # j "Entirely the opposite, I’d venture."
    j "我敢说，恰恰相反。"

# game/episode017.rpy:845
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_49827d51:

    # woman "But what knowledge do you seek?"
    woman "但你们想打听什么消息？"

# game/episode017.rpy:846
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_4dceb304:

    # c "From the last message we received from her, she was staying in the planet’s capital."
    c "从我们收到的她最后一条信息来看，她当时待在这颗星球的首都。"

# game/episode017.rpy:847
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_625a84ac:

    # c "The capital supposedly still stands, so we are looking for a way to land somewhere near and extract our friend."
    c "据说首都尚未沦陷，所以我们正在寻找方法，希望在附近降落并接应我们的朋友。"

# game/episode017.rpy:849
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_fca751fc:

    # woman "That sounds like suicide."
    woman "这听起来像是自杀行为。"

# game/episode017.rpy:850
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_3ae61e2d:

    # c "She means a lot to us."
    c "她对我们来说非常重要。"

# game/episode017.rpy:852
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_3fb9cc2f:

    # woman "Our latest reports, coming from those who have fled our planet recently, indicate that the planet is surrounded."
    woman "我们最近从刚逃离我们星球的人那里得到的报告显示，这个星球已被完全包围。"

# game/episode017.rpy:853
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_811b2324:

    # woman "The Sovereignty has so far resisted bombing the city, probably because of the Grand Arch of Taag."
    woman "至高权域至今没有轰炸这座城市，很可能是因为塔格大拱门。"

# game/episode017.rpy:855
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_03b4917e:

    # zi "The Grand Arch?"
    zi "大拱门？"

# game/episode017.rpy:856
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_313fabd6:

    # woman "It’s a landmark religious site near the center of the city."
    woman "那是城市中心附近的一个地标性宗教遗址。"

# game/episode017.rpy:857
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_0862ae4e:

    # woman "The arch was there before us Taagmar sprang into existence on the planet, the capital has grown around it."
    woman "这座拱门在我们塔格玛人出现在这个星球之前就存在了，首都城市是围绕着它发展起来的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:858
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_bf2c051e:

    # woman "The Sovereignty seems to have taken an interest in this structure, considering several strike teams that were intercepted near the building."
    woman "至高权域似乎对这个建筑很感兴趣，考虑到有几支突击队在建筑附近被拦截。"

# game/episode017.rpy:860
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_a574536c:

    # woman "If your friend has been lucky so far, she’ll probably be near the arch, as it’s relatively safe there, currently."
    woman "如果你的朋友至今还算幸运，她很可能就在拱门附近，因为那里目前相对安全。"

# game/episode017.rpy:861
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_74ecb2c9:

    # woman "As for a safe way to enter our planet’s atmosphere, I have no idea, the entire planet is a warzone."
    woman "至于安全进入我们星球大气层的方法，我毫无头绪，整个星球都是战区。"

# game/episode017.rpy:862
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_fe7a2df2:

    # c "We understand."
    c "我们明白了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:863
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_1a66133e:

    # c "We’ll find a way to get to the planet."
    c "我们会想办法抵达那颗行星。"

# game/episode017.rpy:864
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_ec51aef4:

    # c "Thank you for the information."
    c "感谢您提供的信息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:866
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_330a548a:

    # "The Taagmar priestess resumed her meditation as we made our way back through the residential area to our ship."
    "当我们穿过住宅区返回飞船时，这位塔格玛女祭司重新开始了冥想。"

# game/episode017.rpy:879
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_c7100d45:

    # c "So, what do you think?"
    c "那么，你怎么看？"

# game/episode017.rpy:882
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_4b92a10c:

    # zi "I’m mostly wondering which friend we’re going to rescue?"
    zi "我主要在想我们要去救的是哪位朋友？"

# game/episode017.rpy:884
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_de695f35:

    # j "I’m mostly wondering which friend we’re going to rescue?"
    j "我主要在想我们要去救的是哪位朋友？"

# game/episode017.rpy:885
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_d6d86f9c:

    # c "I’m sure that will remain a mystery until the heat death of the universe."
    c "我敢肯定这将成为宇宙热寂之前的未解之谜。"

# game/episode017.rpy:887
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_252e2f3a:

    # zi "Did you really need to lie to the Taagmar priestess?"
    zi "你真的有必要对那位塔格玛女祭司撒谎吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:888
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_0119c04e:

    # c "I didn’t see any other way to give a plausible reason for our interest in the invasion of their capital."
    c "我当时想不出其他更合理的理由来解释我们为何对他们首都遭入侵如此关注。"

# game/episode017.rpy:890
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_e6f253be:

    # j "At least we have a clear idea where to look."
    j "至少我们明确了要搜索的区域。"

# game/episode017.rpy:892
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_5fd62287:

    # zi "Flying into that warzone with a civilian ship seems incredibly dangerous, though."
    zi "不过开着民用飞船进入那个战区似乎极其危险。"

# game/episode017.rpy:893
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_e85a256a:

    # c "Yes, especially considering the Sovereignty has such a hard-on for us."
    c "没错，尤其考虑到\"至高权域\"对我们如此虎视眈眈。"

# game/episode017.rpy:894
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_189bb1df:

    # c "They’ll probably flag us the moment we break atmosphere."
    c "我们一突破大气层他们可能就会标记我们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:896
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_66c09489:

    # j "Maybe Thyia could mask our ship’s identifier again?"
    j "也许塞娅能再次屏蔽我们飞船的识别码？"

# game/episode017.rpy:897
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_097b0296:

    # c "Maybe, but that still means landing a non-Sovereignty craft amidst an active conflict."
    c "也许可以，但这仍然意味着要在激烈冲突中降落一艘非\"至高权域\"飞船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:898
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_18d92ffd:

    # c "I think we need to head back and discuss our options."
    c "我认为我们需要回去商讨对策。"

# game/episode017.rpy:903
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_6b868edf:

    # "At that moment, we all received an urgent message from Thyia."
    "就在那时，我们都收到了塞娅发来的紧急信息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:904
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_2c55597d:

    # th "You all need to come back to the Bastard!"
    th "你们必须立刻回到\"私生子\"号！"

# game/episode017.rpy:905
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_badc6d5b:

    # th "I’ve just spotted Glixken and his mercenaries on the station."
    th "我刚在空间站发现了格里克森和他的雇佣兵。"

# game/episode017.rpy:906
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_058c8683:

    # th "They appear to be looking for us."
    th "他们似乎正在找我们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:907
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_0a830946:

    # c "Fuck!"
    c "操！"

# game/episode017.rpy:908
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_011d031d:

    # c "Let’s run."
    c "我们快跑。"

# game/episode017.rpy:910
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_e4470065:

    # c "Be careful we don’t run into Glixken on our way to the Bastard."
    c "小心别在回\"私生子\"号的路上撞见格里克森。"

# game/episode017.rpy:912
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_f755e65b:

    # "We reached the docks without encountering Glixken, nor any of his mercenaries."
    "我们到达码头时没有遇到格里克森，也没碰上他的任何雇佣兵。"

# game/episode017.rpy:914
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_f567643a:

    # "Lilly, Thyia and Céline were waiting for us on the bridge."
    "莉莉、塞娅和瑟琳正在舰桥上等我们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:915
translate simplified_chinese ep017_docks_refugee_46ea4eab:

    # "The rest of the crew was supposedly spread around the ship to prepare for a hasty departure."
    "其他船员据说分散在飞船各处，为紧急启航做准备。"

# game/episode017.rpy:919
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_baf7b638:

    # c "Everyone here?"
    c "人都到齐了吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:921
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_113e24a7:

    # l "No, [p_name_short], we're missing Eva."
    l "不，[p_name_short]，伊娃还没到。"

# game/episode017.rpy:922
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_023d7daa:

    # c "I thought she was with you?"
    c "我以为她和你在一起？"

# game/episode017.rpy:924
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_d94967d7:

    # l "She was, but we got separated when we got the news."
    l "她本来是的，但我们收到消息后就失散了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:925
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_20d5a4b8:

    # l "I looked all over the place for her, but then I had a near run-in with some of Glixken's men."
    l "我到处找过她，但后来差点撞上格里克森的手下。"

# game/episode017.rpy:926
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_aab23d1b:

    # c "Well, fuck!"
    c "妈的！"

# game/episode017.rpy:927
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_d3044c73:

    # c "Isn't she responding to any calls?"
    c "她没接任何通讯吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:929
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_d380fab3:

    # ce "She isn't, but the coverage isn't great on the lower levels of the station."
    ce "没接，但空间站底层的信号覆盖不太好。"

# game/episode017.rpy:931
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3fe7a298:

    # th "We need to leave, [p_name]."
    th "我们得走了，[p_name]。"

# game/episode017.rpy:933
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_087e56cb:

    # c "And leave my sister here to those fucking mercs?!"
    c "难道要把我妹妹留给那些该死的佣兵？！"

# game/episode017.rpy:935
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_8bc9cafa:

    # c "And leave Eva here to those fucking mercs?!"
    c "难道要把伊娃留给那些该死的佣兵？！"

# game/episode017.rpy:936
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3a8f8e20:

    # c "I'm going to look for her."
    c "我要去找她。"

# game/episode017.rpy:938
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_1ccd2c61:

    # l "I’m coming with."
    l "我跟你一起去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:939
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_cb2a96e5:

    # c "No, I can move faster on my own."
    c "不，我一个人行动更快。"

# game/episode017.rpy:940
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b050c436:

    # c "Power up the ship, Céline and wait for me."
    c "瑟琳，启动飞船引擎等我。"

# game/episode017.rpy:941
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_418db9d9:

    # c "On what level did you leave her behind, Lilly?"
    c "莉莉，你在哪一层跟她分开的？"

# game/episode017.rpy:943
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_06d67262:

    # l "We were on level six."
    l "我们在第六层。"

# game/episode017.rpy:944
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_2dda03fc:

    # c "Good, I'm heading out."
    c "好，我这就出发。"

# game/episode017.rpy:945
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_9d63e42b:

    # c "If Glixken and his cronies decide to visit the hangar bay, just fly out of here and put as much distance between you and the station."
    c "如果格里克森和他那帮手下要来机库，你们直接飞走，离空间站越远越好。"

# game/episode017.rpy:946
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_69f342b0:

    # c "I'll find some other way to meet up with you all later."
    c "我会另想办法跟你们会合。"

# game/episode017.rpy:948
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_1eed4750:

    # "Before anyone could object, I jumped out of the ship and exited the docks."
    "没等任何人反对，我就跳出飞船离开了码头。"

# game/episode017.rpy:949
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4fabba4b:

    # "Level six was on the other side of the station."
    "第六层在空间站的另一头。"

# game/episode017.rpy:951
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b9a82146:

    # "Luckily, the station was so crowded, I could blend in most of the time."
    "幸好空间站人潮拥挤，大部分时间我都能混入人群。"

# game/episode017.rpy:952
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a28ff3ef:

    # "There was no sight of Glixken or his mercenaries yet."
    "还没有看到格里克森或他的雇佣兵。"

# game/episode017.rpy:953
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a5e1f494:

    # "As soon as I reached level six, I tried calling Eva again."
    "我一到达六层，就再次尝试呼叫伊娃。"

# game/episode017.rpy:954
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_e5db393f:

    # "She still didn’t pick up."
    "她仍然没有接听。"

# game/episode017.rpy:955
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_be24f720:

    # "I was about to put the tablet away when it buzzed."
    "我正要收起平板电脑时，它震动了起来。"

# game/episode017.rpy:956
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_dee3e53b:

    # "A written message from Eva."
    "一条来自伊娃的书面信息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:957
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_d492b027:

    # "“Holed up on level six. Utility room 12B. Glixken mercs everywhere. I don’t know what to do!”"
    "“被困在六层。设备间12B。到处都是格里克森的雇佣兵。我不知道该怎么办！”"

# game/episode017.rpy:959
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a9540014:

    # "I messaged Eva back and told her to sit tight as I started to cross level six to the utility room where my sister was hiding."
    "我回复伊娃，告诉她耐心等待，同时我开始穿过六层前往我妹妹藏身的设备间。"

# game/episode017.rpy:961
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_5f9886e8:

    # "I messaged Eva back and told her to sit tight as I started to cross level six to the utility room where my friend was hiding."
    "我回复伊娃，告诉她耐心等待，同时我开始穿过六层前往我朋友藏身的设备间。"

# game/episode017.rpy:962
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_30cec001:

    # "Most of the refugees were concentrated in the areas surrounding the docks, so this level was noticeably less crowded."
    "大部分难民都集中在码头周边区域，所以这一层明显不那么拥挤。"

# game/episode017.rpy:963
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_9fc574b2:

    # "I was about to turn a corner when I heard the grating sound of what I thought was Glixken’s voice."
    "我正要转过一个拐角时，听到了刺耳的声音，我以为那是格里克森的嗓音。"

# game/episode017.rpy:965
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_308edd03:

    # "Looking carefully around the corner, I saw several of Glixken’s mercs patrolling the area."
    "我小心翼翼地探出头去，看到格里克森的几名雇佣兵正在该区域巡逻。"

# game/episode017.rpy:966
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_5a257408:

    # "Two of them were talking to each other, but Glixken was nowhere in sight."
    "其中两人正在交谈，但并未见到格里克森的身影。"

# game/episode017.rpy:967
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_29258a06:

    # "The utility room was across the mercs, in a corridor."
    "那个杂物间就在雇佣兵对面的走廊里。"

# game/episode017.rpy:968
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_550b5f91:

    # "The only way to reach it was to sneak past the patrol."
    "要想过去，唯一的办法就是悄悄溜过巡逻队。"

# game/episode017.rpy:969
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_fb4310cf:

    # "Glixken’s men didn’t appear to be on high alert."
    "格里克森的手下看起来并没有高度警戒。"

# game/episode017.rpy:970
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_28861f26:

    # "While I tried to determine a pattern in their patrols, Glixken arrived."
    "就在我试图找出他们巡逻的规律时，格里克森出现了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:972
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4b783539:

    # gl "What the fuck are you still doing here?"
    gl "你们他妈还在这里干什么？"

# game/episode017.rpy:974
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6c1d4a5a:

    # man "We thought we saw the girl here."
    man "我们以为在这里看到了那个女孩。"

# game/episode017.rpy:976
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_0ae79cb4:

    # gl "And instead of searching, you decided to act like the fucking neighborhood watch?!"
    gl "结果你们不去搜查，反倒当起他妈的社区巡逻队了？！"

# game/episode017.rpy:977
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_7369a073:

    # man "We thought-"
    man "我们以为-"

# game/episode017.rpy:978
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_dc85c132:

    # gl "Shut up and follow me to the docks!"
    gl "闭嘴，跟我去码头！"

# game/episode017.rpy:979
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_18e70d98:

    # gl "We found their ship, the girl is likely already on it."
    gl "我们找到了他们的船，那女孩很可能已经在船上了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:981
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_de80ea84:

    # "I couldn’t hear the rest of what they were saying."
    "我听不清他们后面在说什么。"

# game/episode017.rpy:982
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3e488586:

    # "My call to warn Céline of the incoming mercs failed, probably the reason why Lilly lost contact with Eva earlier."
    "我打电话提醒瑟琳有雇佣兵来袭失败了，这大概就是莉莉之前与伊娃失去联系的原因。"

# game/episode017.rpy:983
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_fae2ec74:

    # "The crew of the Bastard was on alert, so I just hoped they would escape the docks as soon as Glixken and his troops were spotted."
    "\"私生子\"号的船员们已经进入警戒状态，所以我只希望他们能在格里克森和他的部队被发现后尽快逃离码头。"

# game/episode017.rpy:985
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_fce52292:

    # "My way to Eva was now clear, so I hurried across towards the corridor."
    "通往伊娃的路现在畅通无阻，于是我匆忙穿过走廊。"

# game/episode017.rpy:986
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_e628bfe6:

    # "The door to room 12B appeared to be locked, so I knocked."
    "12B房间的门似乎是锁着的，所以我敲了敲门。"

# game/episode017.rpy:987
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_66b0a42a:

    # c "Eva, it’s me!"
    c "伊娃，是我！"

# game/episode017.rpy:988
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c1da6d66:

    # "The door slid open in response."
    "门应声滑开。"

# game/episode017.rpy:990
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_43bda2bc:

    # "Eva stood inside the room, holding a wrench and ready to hit me over the head."
    "伊娃站在房间里，手里拿着一把扳手，准备砸向我的脑袋。"

# game/episode017.rpy:991
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_16e8b20a:

    # e "I’m so glad it’s you."
    e "我真高兴是你。"

# game/episode017.rpy:993
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c4c59048:

    # e "Are they gone?"
    e "他们走了吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:994
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_d96f5eea:

    # c "They are."
    c "走了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:996
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_9015c3b0:

    # e "I was so scared, [p_name_short]!"
    e "我好害怕，[p_name_short]！"

# game/episode017.rpy:997
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_e5464acb:

    # "Eva trembled as I took her into my arms."
    "当我将伊娃拥入怀中时，她还在颤抖。"

# game/episode017.rpy:998
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c486755b:

    # e "Lilly and I got separated at some point, and just as I was on my way back to meet her, we got that message from Thyia."
    e "我和莉莉不知怎么就走散了，就在我准备回去找她时，我们收到了塞娅的消息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:999
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_84660cfe:

    # e "And then two of those mercenaries came around the corner."
    e "然后那两个雇佣兵就出现在拐角处。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1000
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6e546c65:

    # e "I panicked and ran."
    e "我一时惊慌就跑了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1002
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_63d679bd:

    # e "They followed me to this level, but I managed to slip into this room and lock the door."
    e "他们一直追我到这一层，但我设法溜进这个房间锁上了门。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1003
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_557d47fc:

    # e "I don’t think they saw me go in, because they didn’t pursue."
    e "我觉得他们没看见我进来，因为他们没有继续追。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1004
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_66c668ec:

    # e "When I dared to go back out, they were patrolling the area, covering all the exits."
    e "当我鼓起勇气再出去时，他们正在巡逻这片区域，把守所有出口。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1005
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_5dd4a361:

    # c "They’re gone now."
    c "他们现在已经走了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1006
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_d65e25b0:

    # c "Glixken has discovered the ship in the docking bay."
    c "格里克森已经发现停泊港里的飞船了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1008
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_ec89e394:

    # e "Oh no!{w} The rest of the crew is aware, right?"
    e "糟了！{w}其他船员应该知道了吧？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1009
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_f3287c7b:

    # c "No, but I told them to keep watch and flee in case of danger."
    c "不知道，但我告诉过他们要警戒，遇到危险就撤离。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1010
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_161cf5e6:

    # c "I can’t get a message out to the ship from here, but I hope they’re already gone."
    c "我在这里没法给飞船发消息，只希望他们已经离开了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1012
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b83a4818:

    # e "But that means we’re stranded here, doesn’t it?"
    e "但这样我们就困在这里了，对吧？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1013
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_5ea74252:

    # c "Not if I can help it."
    c "只要我能想办法就不会。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1014
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_df68c15b:

    # c "Back to the docks."
    c "回停泊港去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1016
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c15422a0:

    # "We ran as fast as we could, but skidded to a halt near the first stairway."
    "我们以最快速度奔跑，但在第一个楼梯口附近猛地刹住了脚步。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1018
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_98dba0e3:

    # "Glixken had apparently left a sentry behind who was standing guard at the top."
    "格里克森显然在楼梯顶端留下了一名哨兵把守。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1020
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_f0d3dde3:

    # "I motioned Eva to hide behind a pillar and drew my gun."
    "我示意伊娃躲到柱子后面，同时拔出了枪。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1024
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_f2dab486:

    # "Luckily, this area of the station wasn't as crowded as the docks, so I didn't think there was much need for stealth."
    "幸运的是，空间站的这个区域不像码头那么拥挤，所以我觉得没必要太隐蔽。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1025
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6300e757:

    # "The guard didn't have a clue he was about to get shot in the head as I slowly climbed the stairs."
    "当我缓缓爬上楼梯时，那个守卫完全没意识到自己即将被爆头。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1027
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6094e1d9:

    # "I trained my gun on the back of his head and pulled the trigger."
    "我将枪口对准他的后脑勺，扣动了扳机。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1029
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_fef25a91:

    # "The energy beam went straight through his skull, part of it exploding in a spray of blood and gore."
    "能量束直接穿透了他的颅骨，部分头颅随着血肉飞溅而炸开。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1030
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a7b4c6da:

    # "There was no sound, apart from the fleshy explosion and the last breath gurgling out of the merc's throat as he fell face-first on the floor."
    "除了肉体爆裂的声响和这名佣兵面朝下倒地时喉咙里发出的最后一声咕噜，再没有其他声音。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1032
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_853eec1b:

    # "Leaving a dead body out in the open didn't seem like a great idea, so I grabbed his legs and pulled him down the stairs."
    "把尸体留在显眼处似乎不太明智，于是我抓住他的腿将他拖下楼梯。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1033
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c37f43ed:

    # "The blood smears would undoubtedly be noticed by anyone passing by, but maybe hiding the body would give us some time."
    "血迹无疑会被路过的人发现，但藏起尸体或许能为我们争取些时间。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1035
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_8e63d223:

    # "Together with Eva, I stowed the merc in the storeroom where my sister had hidden herself earlier."
    "我和伊娃一起将这名佣兵塞进了我妹妹先前藏身的储藏室。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1037
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_2656c57b:

    # "Together with Eva, I stowed the merc in the storeroom where my friend had hidden herself earlier."
    "我和伊娃一起把那名雇佣兵藏进了我朋友之前躲藏的那个储藏室。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1038
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_cf4c19b5:

    # "If Eva was disturbed by my actions, I didn't notice it, she performed the necessary tasks with grim dedication."
    "如果伊娃被我的举动惊扰到了，我并没有察觉，她只是带着冷酷的专注完成了必要的工作。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1040
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c14a04ca:

    # "While this area of the station wasn't as crowded as the docks, people still passed through to get to the residential areas."
    "虽然空间站的这片区域不像码头那么拥挤，但人们仍然会经过这里前往居住区。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1041
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3f3bede0:

    # "I had to take the merc out quick and silent."
    "我必须迅速而安静地解决掉这个佣兵。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1043
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_ab610ade:

    # "I had my gun trained at the back of his head, just in case, but the guard didn't turn around when I slowly climbed the stairs."
    "为防万一，我的枪一直瞄准着他的后脑勺，但当我缓缓爬上楼梯时，那个守卫并没有转身。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1045
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_f3e887b4:

    # "As I neared him, I holstered my weapon and took the merc in a choke hold."
    "当我靠近他时，我收起武器，用锁喉技制住了这个佣兵。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1046
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_16791040:

    # "He flailed and tried to wrestle himself away from me."
    "他拼命挣扎，试图从我手中挣脱。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1047
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b8a400cd:

    # "As he was about to cry out, I locked my arm against his windpipe, slowly choking him into unconsciousness."
    "就在他快要喊出声时，我用胳膊锁住他的气管，慢慢将他勒至昏迷。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1048
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_56a7d64f:

    # "When he stopped flailing, I guided the merc towards the floor, kicking away the gun he dropped."
    "当他停止挣扎后，我扶着佣兵倒向地面，同时踢开他掉落的枪。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1050
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_507d472e:

    # "Leaving a body out in the open didn't seem like a great idea, so I grabbed his legs and pulled him down the stairs."
    "把尸体留在明处似乎不是个好主意，于是我抓住他的双腿，将他拖下楼梯。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1052
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_8e63d223_1:

    # "Together with Eva, I stowed the merc in the storeroom where my sister had hidden herself earlier."
    "我和伊娃一起，把那个雇佣兵藏进了我妹妹之前躲藏的那个储藏室。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1054
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_2656c57b_1:

    # "Together with Eva, I stowed the merc in the storeroom where my friend had hidden herself earlier."
    "我和伊娃一起，把那个雇佣兵藏进了我朋友之前躲藏的那个储藏室。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1056
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_5a46fb0f:

    # "Our way clear, we ran towards the docks."
    "清除了障碍后，我们向码头跑去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1058
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_5d26b1f2:

    # "Nearing the hangar bays, we slowed down, watching for any remnants of Glixken's crew that might still be on the lookout for us."
    "接近机库时，我们放慢了脚步，警惕着可能仍在搜寻我们的格里克森手下残余分子。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1063
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_2d1c1b05:

    # "The halls were still filled with refugees, but there was no trace of Glixken or his mercenaries."
    "走廊里仍然挤满了难民，但格里克森和他的雇佣兵们已不见踪影。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1064
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_db6c7d23:

    # "The Iron Bastard was nowhere to be seen either, its original berth now empty."
    "\"钢铁私生子\"号也无处可寻，它原来的泊位现在空荡荡的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1065
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_2a00cbc5:

    # c "I think they've escaped."
    c "我想他们已经逃走了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1067
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_ef7539ba:

    # e "What now?"
    e "现在怎么办？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1068
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_8fd9c9f0:

    # c "Now we commandeer a ship."
    c "现在我们征用一艘飞船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1070
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_231b8f30:

    # e "Won't station security be all over us?"
    e "空间站安保不会来抓我们吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1071
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b9de6dcb:

    # c "Only when we fail to secure a ship."
    c "只有在我们抢不到飞船的时候才会。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1072
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3e6d5a86:

    # c "Security is stretched thin as it is because of the refugee crisis."
    c "由于难民危机，安保力量本就捉襟见肘。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1073
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4b4f1571:

    # c "I highly doubt they'll be able to get a team to us in time, let alone pursue outside the station."
    c "我高度怀疑他们能否及时派出队伍来抓我们，更别说追到空间站外面了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1075
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_26172bf6:

    # e "It's risky, but I guess we don't have a choice."
    e "这很冒险，但我想我们别无选择。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1076
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_baa4168c:

    # c "I think we don't."
    c "我觉得确实没有。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1077
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_153b6e7e:

    # c "Also, I just happen to know which ship to steal."
    c "而且，我刚好知道该偷哪艘船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1079
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_e42dcaaa:

    # "Eva followed me to the place where I had my encounter with the alien earlier."
    "伊娃跟着我来到之前与外星人遭遇的地方。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1081
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_33ccc2ee:

    # "Their ship was still moored there."
    "他们的飞船还停靠在那里。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1082
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_5556fc66:

    # "The canopy was open and the alien was inspecting one of the engines of the vessel."
    "座舱盖开着，那个外星人正在检查飞船的某个引擎。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1083
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_1e9f3096:

    # c "Stay close."
    c "跟紧我。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1085
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_1fc2ebb6:

    # "As I approached the alien, I pulled the gun from my holster."
    "当我靠近那个外星人时，我从枪套中拔出了枪。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1086
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_bb598f7c:

    # c "Hey, you there!"
    c "嘿，那边的你！"

# game/episode017.rpy:1087
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_83ef93db:

    # c "Remember me?"
    c "还记得我吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1088
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4605924b:

    # "Several bystanders started running at the sight of the unholstered weapon."
    "几名旁观者看到拔出的武器后开始逃跑。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1089
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_7af0daa7:

    # "I needed to be quick about it, as some of them would undoubtedly alert station security."
    "我必须速战速决，因为他们中肯定有人会去通知空间站安保。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1090
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4721f585:

    # c "Hands in the air."
    c "把手举起来。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1091
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a6064ca2:

    # c "Slowly step away from your ship."
    c "慢慢从你的飞船旁走开。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1094
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_9ebfbff3:

    # man "What is it now?"
    man "现在又有什么事？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1096
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c9ed515a:

    # man "Haven’t punished me enough?"
    man "还没惩罚够我吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1098
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6b66297d:

    # man "I apologized, didn’t I?"
    man "我不是道歉过了吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1099
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4167b6ca:

    # c "I’m in need of a ship."
    c "我需要一艘船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1100
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_59ba0fcc:

    # c "And since you’re a cunt harassing women, I figured I might as well take yours."
    c "既然你是个骚扰女人的混蛋，我觉得不如直接抢你的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1101
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_894e9bdb:

    # c "Are the keys still in the ignition?"
    c "钥匙还插在点火器上吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1103
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c8f7e8fe:

    # man "Fuck you."
    man "去你妈的。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1104
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_0101d2e2:

    # c "I take that as a yes."
    c "我就当你是承认了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1105
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_97d0dfd9:

    # c "Stay behind me, Eva."
    c "跟紧我，伊娃。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1107
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_015be0df:

    # "The gun still trained on the fuming alien, Eva and I climbed on the wing of the ship."
    "枪口始终对准那个怒气冲冲的外星人，我和伊娃爬上了飞船的机翼。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1109
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_022fdcd8:

    # "The owner was now running towards us, screaming at the top of his lungs."
    "船主正朝我们冲来，声嘶力竭地叫喊着。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1111
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b71448e3:

    # "We both strapped in, and I switched on the engines."
    "我们系好安全带，我启动了引擎。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1112
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_32e3afe2:

    # "The canopy of the ship closed, shutting out the angry yells of the alien."
    "飞船座舱罩缓缓关闭，将外星人的怒吼隔绝在外。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1113
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_896ed572:

    # c "Ready for take-off."
    c "准备起飞。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1114
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_cd683b0c:

    # c "Can you see if you can locate the Bastard as soon as we clear the station?"
    c "我们一离开空间站，你能尽快找到\"私生子\"号的位置吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1115
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_1516c223:

    # e "On it."
    e "正在处理。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1117
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3ff945ba:

    # "There were no alarms, nor any communication from the station’s traffic control."
    "没有警报，也没有收到空间站交通管制的任何通讯。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1119
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_ad9e69b7:

    # "Our ship was cleared automatically, and I kicked it into high gear as soon as we sped out of the hangar bay."
    "我们的飞船自动获得放行许可，一冲出机库我就立刻加速。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1120
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_bd6f0ca7:

    # c "Nobody is shooting at us yet."
    c "目前还没人朝我们开火。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1122
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_28372ec1:

    # e "Let’s keep it that way."
    e "继续保持这种状态。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1123
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_0ee159a1:

    # c "Any luck finding the Bastard?"
    c "找到\"私生子\"号了吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1125
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_30a52b9f:

    # e "Not yet..."
    e "还没…"

# game/episode017.rpy:1126
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_8e683b4d:

    # e "I did find a bag of supplies tucked underneath my chair, though."
    e "不过我倒是在座位底下发现了一袋补给品。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1127
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_30d8bc15:

    # c "Good, at least we’ll have some snacks for this trip."
    c "很好，至少这趟旅途我们还有些零食。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1129
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_461c447a:

    # e "Still no sign of the Bastard."
    e "还是没发现\"私生子\"号的踪迹。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1130
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a0621e7b:

    # e "Wait!"
    e "等等！"

# game/episode017.rpy:1132
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_afd030ed:

    # e "Yes, they’re still in this system."
    e "找到了，他们还在这个星系里。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1133
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4f0ca6fc:

    # e "Traveling at high speed, though."
    e "不过正在高速航行。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1134
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6af78cfb:

    # c "Then let’s see what this ship can do."
    c "那就让我们看看这艘船的本事。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1135
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_7d409743:

    # c "The owner of this ship being a cunt was just one of the reasons for stealing this particular bucket."
    c "原船主人是个混蛋，这只是我们偷这艘破船的原因之一。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1136
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_ca337bc4:

    # c "This type is often used for races, so it should be able to reach some impressive speeds."
    c "这种型号常被用于竞速，应该能达到相当惊人的速度。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1138
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_296bd773:

    # e "Enough to overtake the Bastard?"
    e "足够追上\"私生子\"号吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1139
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6eeb6a30:

    # c "Let’s hope so."
    c "希望如此。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1140
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a25dfe9e:

    # c "Just be warned, it won’t be a very pleasant flight."
    c "但提醒你，这趟飞行可不会太舒服。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1142
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_540fef08:

    # e "Understood, just hit it."
    e "明白，尽管加速。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1144
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3c69814c:

    # "I accelerated and we stormed towards the coordinates of the Bastard."
    "我加速推进，朝着\"私生子\"号的坐标疾驰而去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1145
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a9afa599:

    # "The tremendous forces pressing upon us were almost too much to bear."
    "施加在我们身上的巨大压力几乎令人难以承受。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1146
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_cd43b6c9:

    # "Through clenched teeth, Eva attempted to speak."
    "伊娃咬紧牙关，试图开口说话。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1147
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_0227d02e:

    # e "The...{w} Bastard...{w} Is being...{w} Pursued..."
    e "\"私生子\"…号{w}正在…{w}被…{w}追击…"

# game/episode017.rpy:1149
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_7b9bcf5b:

    # "When we were in range, I hit the brakes, and the pressure eventually returned to normal."
    "当我们进入射程范围时，我启动了制动装置，压力终于恢复正常。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1150
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_cf578197:

    # "I could see that Eva was right about the Bastard being pursued."
    "我能看到伊娃说得没错，\"私生子\"号确实在被追击。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1151
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_db126bdc:

    # c "Probably Glixken trying to catch them."
    c "很可能是格里克森在追捕他们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1152
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_63923111:

    # e "That seems very likely."
    e "这看起来很有可能。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1153
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b2abd033:

    # e "They’re flying at approximately the same speed, that other ship trailing some distance behind it."
    e "他们正以近似相同的速度飞行，那艘陌生飞船在后方保持着一定距离。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1154
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_f5b93369:

    # c "Let’s see if we can fuck him from behind somehow."
    c "看看我们能不能从后面干他一把。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1155
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_52815c57:

    # "Plotting a course to line us up with Glixken and the Bastard, I had Eva unlock the weapons system."
    "规划航线让我们与格里克森和\"私生子\"号排成直线，我让伊娃解锁了武器系统。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1157
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_bafb3969:

    # "When both ships came into view, our suspicions were confirmed."
    "当两艘飞船都进入视野时，我们的怀疑得到了证实。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1159
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_188f1b98:

    # "The unknown ship assaulted the Bastard with continuous PBC fire."
    "那艘不明飞船用持续不断的粒子束加农炮火力攻击着\"私生子\"号。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1160
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_be5fc8ed:

    # "They must not have noticed us yet, because both ships remained committed to firing upon each other."
    "他们肯定还没注意到我们，因为两艘飞船仍在专注地互相射击。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1162
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_17a33c16:

    # c "Ready?"
    c "准备好了吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1164
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_e05651bd:

    # e "Ready, on your-"
    e "准备好了，听你-"

# game/episode017.rpy:1166
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_90466b6a:

    # e "Fuck! The Bastard’s been hit."
    e "妈的！\"私生子\"号被击中了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1168
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_9a665faa:

    # "Glixken had indeed scored a direct hit on the Bastard’s rear."
    "格里克森确实直接命中了\"私生子\"号的尾部。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1169
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_0f660a52:

    # "Céline was still trying to evade most of the PBC fire that rained down on them, but they were having an increasingly hard time."
    "瑟琳仍在努力躲避大部分倾泻而下的粒子束加农炮火，但她们越来越难以招架。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1170
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_6b9c4871:

    # c "Shoot those fuckers."
    c "干掉那些混蛋。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1172
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_997fe78a:

    # "Eva loosed our cannons at Glixken."
    "伊娃朝格里克森的飞船开火了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1174
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_a7077e25:

    # "Possibly due to the fact that we caught them unaware, Eva managed to score a direct hit on Glixken’s ship."
    "可能是由于我们打了他们个措手不及，伊娃成功击中了格里克森的飞船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1175
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_f2d883c1:

    # c "Good shot!"
    c "好枪法！"

# game/episode017.rpy:1177
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_1c69494b:

    # "Our happiness was shortlived, as several of the enemy ship’s cannons turned towards us."
    "但我们的喜悦转瞬即逝，因为敌舰的数门炮口转向了我们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1178
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_2f3137fc:

    # c "Keep firing, I’ll try to evade."
    c "继续开火，我来试着规避。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1179
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_0e3d1a89:

    # "Glixken now had to divide his attention, allowing the Bastard some respite."
    "格里克森现在不得不分心应付，让\"私生子\"号得以喘息。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1180
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b0a5923a:

    # "The distance between the two ships grew, as the Bastard limped away towards a nearby planet."
    "两艘船之间的距离逐渐拉大，\"私生子\"号蹒跚着朝附近的行星逃去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1181
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_4c2b072a:

    # "Getting out of the firing line proved to be very difficult."
    "事实证明要脱离火力线非常困难。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1182
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_b966ad40:

    # "Glixken must have diverted more power to the cannons trained on us, as our ship shuddered under the barrage of PBC fire."
    "格里克森肯定是把更多能量转移到了瞄准我们的炮塔上，因为我们的飞船在粒子束炮火的连番轰击下剧烈震颤。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1183
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_52689564:

    # c "We can’t sustain much more."
    c "我们撑不了多久了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1185
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_64780330:

    # "Alarms suddenly went off, and the ship indicated we sustained heavy damage on one of the wings."
    "警报突然响起，飞船显示我们的一侧机翼遭受了重创。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1186
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_e4477a1c:

    # c "I’m going to try and get us out of here."
    c "我试着带大家离开这里。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1187
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_04f0ff4d:

    # e "Understood."
    e "明白。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1189
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_fad91c1b:

    # "Glixken still fired on us as we disengaged and sped towards the same planet the Bastard was heading."
    "在我们脱离战斗、加速驶向\"私生子\"号前往的那颗行星时，格里克森仍在朝我们开火。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1190
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_2bbe2c9a:

    # "The hit we scored must have seriously hampered their ship, because we easily outpaced them, even with one of our wings in tatters."
    "我们刚才那记命中肯定严重损坏了他们的飞船，因为即使我们一侧机翼已经支离破碎，还是轻松甩开了他们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1192
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_163c1a96:

    # "The planet we were approaching appeared to be a dull red orb."
    "我们正在接近的这颗行星看起来是个暗红色的球体。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1196
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_3890e7c7:

    # "By now, Glixken was trailing far behind, still firing PBC rounds at regular intervals, but hitting nothing."
    "此时格里克森已被远远甩在后面，仍在定期发射粒子束炮弹，但全都打偏了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1197
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_c1d52dad:

    # c "We’re about to break atmosphere."
    c "我们即将突破大气层。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1198
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_9c7e787f:

    # c "Brace yourself."
    c "抓紧了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1199
translate simplified_chinese ep017_altum_exit_04b3cf92:

    # "Despite the warning, we were both surprised by the roughness of the descent."
    "尽管有警告，我们俩还是被下降的剧烈颠簸吓了一跳。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1204
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_6194bd2b:

    # "As soon as we entered the planet’s atmosphere, we were hit by a raging sandstorm."
    "刚进入行星大气层，我们就遭遇了猛烈的沙尘暴。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1205
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_df75e619:

    # "The push and pull of the winds was so enormous that I had trouble controlling the ship."
    "风力的推拉作用如此巨大，我很难控制飞船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1206
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_051bc66d:

    # "Sand got everywhere and the ship’s engine was struggling."
    "沙子无孔不入，飞船引擎也在苦苦挣扎。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1207
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_d120093f:

    # c "I’m going to try and put her down."
    c "我试试把她降下去。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1209
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_7fa5481c:

    # "A great mass of sand approached with rapid speed as I attempted to steer us towards a flat area that would support our landing trajectory."
    "当我试图操纵飞船飞向一片能支持我们降落轨迹的平坦区域时，一大片沙尘正快速逼近。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1211
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_447f471c:

    # e "Are we going to make it?"
    e "我们能成功吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1212
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_91666976:

    # "Considering the turbulence we were experiencing, I couldn’t really reassure her."
    "考虑到我们正在经历的湍流，我实在没法给她确切的保证。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1213
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_0a6af8ef:

    # "The engine wheezed and sputtered as the frame of the ship groaned under the forces that were pulling at us."
    "引擎发出喘息般的噼啪声，飞船框架在拉扯我们的力量下嘎吱作响。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1214
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_6c7af131:

    # e "If we...{w} don’t make it...{w} [p_name_short]..."
    e "如果我们…{w} 没能活下来…{w} [p_name_short]…"

# game/episode017.rpy:1215
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_f45b5675:

    # e "I just want to say that..."
    e "我只是想说…"

# game/episode017.rpy:1217
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_d637dea3:

    # e "I love you."
    e "我爱你。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1219
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_7fbca8b4:

    # "I didn’t get a chance to reply as the nose of our ship bored into the surface of the planet at that moment."
    "我还没来得及回答，飞船的机头就在那一刻钻入了行星表面。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1220
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_77654a3a:

    # "The sea of sand halted our descent abruptly."
    "沙海猛地止住了我们的坠落。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1221
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_3f6f7a25:

    # "Luckily, we had lost enough speed to avoid getting compressed into paste."
    "幸运的是，我们已经减速到足够避免被压成肉酱。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1222
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_de98a7cc:

    # "The fire on the wings was now raging, black smoke billowing into the air."
    "机翼上的火焰此刻正熊熊燃烧，黑烟滚滚升空。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1223
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_5d172416:

    # "I nearly lost consciousness just before the ship ground to a halt."
    "就在飞船戛然而停前，我几乎失去意识。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1225
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_64332b2a:

    # "A quick look to my right told me Eva hadn’t been as lucky."
    "迅速向右一瞥，告诉我伊娃就没那么幸运了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1226
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_54ef110d:

    # "Quickly, I unfastened the belt securing me in the pilot’s chair and reached over to free Eva."
    "我迅速解开将我固定在驾驶座上的安全带，探身去解救伊娃。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1229
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_02b12b96:

    # "My sister was still out, so I pulled her out of the chair and dragged her body out of the ship."
    "我妹妹仍然昏迷不醒，所以我将她从椅子上拉出来，拖着她的身体离开了飞船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1231
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_19119c9a:

    # "Eva was still out, so I pulled her out of the chair and dragged her body out of the ship."
    "伊娃仍然昏迷不醒，所以我将她从椅子上拉出来，拖着她的身体离开了飞船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1232
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_fdbe3d84:

    # "The backpack of supplies she’d discovered earlier didn’t seem like a luxury now, so I slung it over my shoulder."
    "她早先发现的补给背包现在看来绝非奢侈品，我便将它甩到肩上。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1233
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_eb00a34c:

    # "By now, the fire had consumed almost all of the ship."
    "此时，火焰几乎吞噬了整艘飞船。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1234
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_900ef7ea:

    # "I had to get us out of there, because once the fire reached the ship’s fuel tanks, we would be in for a very large explosion."
    "我必须带我们离开这里，因为一旦火势蔓延到飞船的燃料箱，我们将面临一场巨大的爆炸。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1235
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_01c4e476:

    # "Eva stirred and tried to open her eyes."
    "伊娃动弹了一下，试图睁开眼睛。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1240
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_95110dff:

    # "Supporting her, I helped Eva get on her feet, and together we limped away from the wreckage."
    "我搀扶着伊娃站起来，一起蹒跚着远离残骸。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1242
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_ea19e345:

    # "As we reached the foot of a sand dune, the ship exploded, sending debris high up in the air."
    "当我们抵达沙丘脚下时，飞船爆炸了，碎片被高高抛向空中。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1243
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_f32f8db7:

    # "Our means of transport destroyed, we had to find the others and hope they made a softer landing than we had."
    "交通工具被毁，我们必须找到其他人，希望他们的降落比我们更平稳些。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1244
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_27b26557:

    # "Glixken presumably landed somewhere on this planet as well and I wasn’t looking forward to running into him first."
    "格里克森大概也降落在这颗星球的某个地方，我可不想第一个撞见他。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1245
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_6d376c8f:

    # "The planet we crashed on could only be described as a hell-hole."
    "我们坠落的这颗行星只能用\"地狱坑\"来形容。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1247
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_4a03e175:

    # "The sandstorm had mostly died down and instead we were treated to temperatures that were well outside our zone of comfort."
    "沙尘暴已基本平息，取而代之的是远超我们舒适区的高温。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1248
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_9d1d6502:

    # "We needed some kind of shelter, as I didn’t know how hot this planet could get during its rotation."
    "我们需要找个遮阳处，因为我不清楚这颗行星在自转期间会变得多热。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1249
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_6b574872:

    # "If this place had some kind of night, temperatures were bound to be extremely cold."
    "如果这个地方存在夜晚，气温必定会变得极冷。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1250
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_f28ab474:

    # "In between two dunes, there was a rocky outcropping I’d pinned my hopes on."
    "在两座沙丘之间，有片岩层露头让我寄予了希望。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1251
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_47cfe5ed:

    # "The boulders that were scattered around might provide us with some much needed shade."
    "散落各处的巨石或许能为我们提供急需的阴凉。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1253
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_79d8f1ae:

    # "Eva could walk by herself at that point, though she was still a little groggy."
    "此时伊娃已能独立行走，虽然仍有些昏沉。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1254
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_2dea5a63:

    # c "Just a little further, Eva."
    c "就快到了，伊娃。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1255
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_7186eae8:

    # e "I can make it."
    e "我能坚持。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1257
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_7b8a5bfc:

    # "Instead of sinking ankle-deep into the sand with every step, the ground near the rocks felt a little more solid."
    "靠近岩石的地面感觉稍微坚实些，不必每步都陷进齐踝深的沙子里。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1259
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_03e49ab2:

    # "We clambered up the outcropping and sat down in the meagre shadow provided by the rocks."
    "我们爬上岩石露头，在石头提供的微薄阴影中坐下。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1261
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_4776f59b:

    # e "Our ship is gone, isn’t it?"
    e "我们的飞船不见了，对吧？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1262
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_66866a14:

    # c "I think the explosion destroyed whatever was left of it."
    c "我觉得爆炸把剩下的部分全毁了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1264
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_0a2cd082:

    # e "I hope the Bastard made a softer landing."
    e "希望\"私生子\"号着陆时能轻一点。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1265
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_6a137b52:

    # c "I do too."
    c "我也希望如此。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1266
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_d8c4c377:

    # c "But we have to find them first."
    c "但我们必须先找到他们。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1268
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_9c5e165f:

    # e "That means trudging around in all this sand, right?"
    e "也就是说要在这一大片沙地里跋涉，对吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1269
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_f0ac2359:

    # c "I’m afraid so."
    c "恐怕是这样。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1270
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_21c5a504:

    # c "I believe there are some supplies in that backpack."
    c "我相信那个背包里有些补给品。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1272
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_a9cfec32:

    # e "Yes, looks like two bedrolls and some food and water."
    e "是的，看起来有两个铺盖卷和一些食物和水。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1273
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_07c1b078:

    # c "We should probably ration it pretty severely, who knows how long we’ll be here."
    c "我们可能得严格配给，谁知道要在这里待多久。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1274
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_52f0e79c:

    # e "I’m extremely thirsty."
    e "我口渴得要命。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1275
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_e0224be1:

    # c "Me too."
    c "我也是。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1276
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_011f3c23:

    # c "But we shouldn’t drink more than a sip."
    c "但咱们最多只能喝一小口。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1278
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_169c5da0:

    # "We both drank from the water bottle and stared at the black cloud still visible on the horizon billowing from the ruin of our ship."
    "我们俩轮流喝了口水瓶里的水，凝视着地平线上仍在翻涌的黑云—那是我们飞船残骸升起的浓烟。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1279
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_d7ab3529:

    # c "I think night will fall soon."
    c "我觉得天快黑了。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1281
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_7c405ee3:

    # e "Will we be safe here for the night?"
    e "我们在这里过夜安全吗？"

# game/episode017.rpy:1282
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_36371bdc:

    # c "I haven’t seen any traces of wild animals, or any other sign of life for that matter."
    c "我还没发现任何野兽的踪迹，也没看到其他生命迹象。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1283
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_40d45b48:

    # c "The nights here will probably be very cold."
    c "这里的夜晚可能会非常寒冷。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1285
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_bb5a8f34:

    # e "At least we have those bedrolls."
    e "至少我们还有那些铺盖卷。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1286
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_751becd6:

    # c "Very thoughtful of the previous owner to include some camping gear."
    c "前主人考虑得真周到，还备了些露营装备。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1287
translate simplified_chinese ep017_crash_1df29e10:

    # c "I didn’t see any tools for making a fire in that backpack though, so lets hope there really aren’t any wild animals."
    c "不过我在背包里没看到生火工具，所以希望这里真的没有野兽出没。"

# game/episode017.rpy:1289
